            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-25T03:02:48.272214+00:00",
            "notes": "Just increasing damage this round. [Smashing!](item_a7021e28-cb8a-4f39-aeb1-380525b3fea9) is the go-to, but if you're having to hold shield a lot, you could maybe take [Barrier Reconstruction](item_ecd5cf3c-0293-42e9-b015-0b00c25082f5) instead (a little underpowered, but it complements the playstyle we're going for really well). Obviously, [Shieldbuster](item_9ee1f150-537d-40b9-b975-7820fb1c6a66) is not reccomended against [Junker Queen](hero_4794d288-27d9-49e0-a1dd-ffe0f4de3ab1), but is an absolute must-pick against [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) and is decent for bullying other tanks.\n\n[Shield Stampede](item_0c4ef690-6472-48fe-9257-864c4381f584) can also be considered if the enemy [Ana](hero_f1aee6cf-704f-455f-a100-ec882ebbe000) or [Reinhardt](hero_a3b6ca2c-6cbd-43dc-bb78-a728e42fba49) is consistently shutting down your initiation.\n\nBuy whatever other commons/rares you can afford, but you can jump to the round 4 build if your econ is particularly good (or if you need more buffs to your sustain rather than your damage).",
