            "created_at": "2025-07-25T03:02:48.272214+00:00",
            "notes": "This is where the build really starts to come online: [Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98) gives the last passive heal we need.\nIn total, our passive self healing per second is 2.5% ([Gloomgauntlet](item_76cb8fe3-3c1f-4769-a1ec-a9c2dc510ba7)) + 3% ([Martian Mender](item_0099632b-4e18-450e-844f-22c40e51bc98)) + 5% ([To Me, My Friends!](item_9bd5bb9d-8026-4092-80c5-21e726c0969f)) = 10.5%. This means that simply swinging every couple seconds while shielding heals you for around 80-90HP per second. Unlike lifesteal builds, this happens while stalling and retreating, and can even be used to save teammates. From this round onward, you might find that you're getting as much as (if not more) healing than your supports.\n\nAn important note is that since we're built into both shielding and damage, try to utilise both as much as possible. Some matchups might force you into one or the other, but either can be built around accordingly with very little dependence on the powers we've chosen.",
