            "cash_earned": 0,
            "created_at": "2025-07-25T03:02:48.272214+00:00",
            "notes": "[Feeling the Burn](item_256f9e9c-c332-42f2-83d9-ad0d47e23399) isn't particularly powerful since the season 2 patch, but it's okay for adding a little more damage to the hammer swing. If your shield is getting destroyed too quickly, [Barrier Reconstruction](item_ecd5cf3c-0293-42e9-b015-0b00c25082f5) is reccomended over [Infusion Generator](item_8aee4021-0d2f-481c-b811-135f2d0fabd8) (since we don't have enough bonus health to justify [Infusion Generator](item_8aee4021-0d2f-481c-b811-135f2d0fabd8) just yet)\n\nAdding [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) gives us a lot more firepower, but [Divine Intervention](item_b5148b7f-8529-4b1b-a90c-5d7cf13f8f0c) works if you want more damage reduction.\n\n[Phantasmic Flux](item_5e644a79-cf6e-4196-8d0a-232f75004643) is a popular item, but I don't think it quite makes the cut for a build in which we have so much passive healing and very little reliance on our abilities. There are simply better options.",
