            "notes": "This is the full-power build, if you cant afford it then just add stuff to the round 6 build. I'm saying this because the three new items this round ([Plan Z](item_8e9dc830-ad05-413a-bcc9-efc0a23d8625), [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) and [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d)) and our new power ([Infusion Generator](item_8aee4021-0d2f-481c-b811-135f2d0fabd8)) all have synergy. If you can only afford one new survival epic, consider [Rustung Von Wilhelm](item_aea17a63-3f55-4f91-8f49-a7793fbc56c4) instead.\n\n[Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8) 's DoT constantly procs all 20 stacks of [Ogundimu Reduction Field](item_b12daf48-069b-44c1-88fe-221cbcff664d), giving a near-permanent 10% damage reduction.\n\nThose survival perks also increase our max HP, meaning we can start to justify taking [Plan Z](item_8e9dc830-ad05-413a-bcc9-efc0a23d8625) over [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) and it lets us get much more value out of [Infusion Generator](item_8aee4021-0d2f-481c-b811-135f2d0fabd8) .",
